pppload 1.0 is an xload-style load monitor for your dialup PPP link.
pppload shows the current average transmit and receive throughput for an
individual link, as well as the total number of bytes tranferred in each
direction.  Both transmit and receive are shown on the same graph, with
horizontal dividing lines every N bytes/sec (default: 512).

pppload uses the Qt 1.0 library, which is available from
http://www.troll.no/.  The following files have been uploaded to sunsite:

pppload-1.0-2.i386.rpm  13395
pppload-1.0-bin.tar.gz  26765
pppload-1.0.tar.gz      15000

The binaries have been linked against Qt 1.0.

Sean
