Messenger users 10
   Number of message display boards is 20
   No direct   
software support (periodic bug fixes are possible)
  
Pricing is provided   
via quotation.  Pricing is based on numbers of 
concurrent users, pagers,   
electronic message displays and concurrent
voice users.  Volume   
discounting and site or enterprise licenses are
available.   
 

