   like genome analysis to align certain groups of sequences.

  This is similar to efetch by Erik  Sonhammer, but is better
  in that you can fetch multiple fasta format sequences and full
  entries by using glob.

  You need to set Swissprot path environment(probably you already
  have it set). 
  
