Dear friends,

I am proud to announce the relase of version 3.0U of the highly popular
conversion utility CONVERT. Previous version 2.6 was only released for
MS-DOS, now this one is finally for UNIX. CONVERT 3.0 incorporates some
new features and will soon be ported to MS-DOS and possibly Windows
platform. 

CONVERT is free, fast, customizable program that can easily port plain
text files between all major Cyrillic encoding systems, including, but not
limited to KOI-8, KOI-7, Alternative for MS-DOS, CP1251, CYRTTF,
TransCyrillic, Cyrillic. Convert 3.0U can also transliterate Cyrillic text
to it's English transliteration and back. 

CONVERT can be used as a general conversion tool, not necessarily for
Cyrillic. 

Complete source code with documentation can be downloaded from the
following Web Page:

	http://www.cyber.com.au/~stargate/Welcome.html

Please find the "Convert" section and feel free to download.

Brief list of features of Convert follows:

    Version 3.0U features
    * greater conversion speed - up to 1Mb/sec (IBM RS/6000, AIX 3.2.5)
    * custom "exclude" character to separate non-convertible parts of text
    * full support of standard input and output - can be used with pipes
      and redirection symbols
    * two-way Cyrillic transliteration - at last!
    * virtually unlimited input/output file sizes
    * new standardized and rich command line interface
    * program status logging for debugging or problem reporting
    * as previous versions - this one is also FREE!!!

Hope some of you may find this useful!

