North Texas Linux Users Group

October Meeting

NTLug will be meeting on October 19th for our second meeting.  We 
will be hosting a mini-Linux Install Party.  Please bring PCs and 
laptops for installation and configuration of Linux, including the 
newest version of RedHat!  We will be installing Linux via LapLink 
